    "description": "Objective\n\nSince a dedicated Player object/app isn't feasible without breaking Console behavior (see POC-23), make the Person Account Record Type more visually prominent on the Player page layout so users can tell Players apart from Referrers/Operators/Partners at a glance.\n\nImplementation Requirements\n\nAdd Record Type as a highlighted field in the highlights panel or header; consider a compact layout adjustment\n\nAcceptance Criteria\n\nRecord Type clearly visible without opening full record detail\n\nOut of Scope\n\nAny change to the underlying Account / Person Account architecture\n\nAdditional Notes\n\nExplicitly deferred — not scheduled for the POC. Do not pull forward before Phase 1 build.\n\n\\----------------------------------------\n\nEstimate: XXS · \\~1h · Dependencies: None (post-POC) · Ticket POC-25 (approved 2026-07-07)\n\nSource: Raised during internal build session, 2026-07-07; explicitly deferred to post-POC.",
